# 2026-08-28 — 400 -> 393. SEVEN rows, and the number was PREDICTED AS SEVEN
# before the edit — though not the same seven. A match GUARD in Rust runs with
# the scrutinee borrowed (E0510): the arm has been provisionally chosen and a
# guard that assigns to the matched place, `&mut`s it or moves it makes that
# choice a lie. logosc raised a loan over a guard only where a `ref`/`ref mut`
# BINDING happened to exist, so the guard itself deposited nothing.
#   issue-27282-mutate-before-diverging-arm-1                      E0510
