# a sibling tuple element, a match that tests NOTHING (`match p { _ if { p.b =
# 5 …`), a harmless guard on a `ref mut` arm, and an indexed scrutinee. What
# landed borrows the places the patterns COMPARE, not the scrutinee, drops an
# implicit loan silently where the user already holds one, and exempts an
# indexed scrutinee. All seven are admitted, and five of them are now pass
# fixtures (tests/logos/pass/bc_guard_*).
